# Views used in shares must be secure views. But they bypass the optimizer.

# If sharing a view that references another database, grant reference usage on other
# database to share. Only thing to remember, view can only be shared within the same
# region if it has reference usage.

# Materialized view (a database object that stores the precomputed results of a query
# as a physical table) cannot have joins in it.

# Dynamic tables can be used instead of materialized views if you need to use joins.
# Should now be used instead of materialized views. New standard.